    "explanation": "The episode was left as a safe open transition: exact admission/surgery and anesthesia timing remained with the treating team, but the family had an action plan, medication cautions, emergency symptoms, and a contact route. The last family message asked for confirmation about phone-call details, so it was not a fully rounded final closure, but the residual risk was bounded by prior instructions.",
